{"title":"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) #5</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) #7</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph shows the complete scoring summary for the last game played by the eight players on Gaussian Guardians intramural basketball team. The total number of points scored by the Gaussian Guardians was\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79c13f9250cfc0f4b4545c0fae36b6b7d92c517d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 54 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 58 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 46$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply look at the bar graph/chart to see how many points each person got, and then add everything up.\n</p><p>Daniel got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points, Curtis got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, Sid got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, Emily got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, Kalyn got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, Hyojeong got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, Ty got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and Winston got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We can now find the total:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/1771f0bc271fa23ce16d7f92d408b7bd3d1aede5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 + 8 + 2 + 11 + 6 + 12 + 1 + 7 = 15 + 13 + 18 + 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"403\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/b/84b24f59735ca7c8e0dd7e569eb1d0f2ac192e51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=28 + 26 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 54}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"169\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Gaus